1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,902
Data safety FLOWRA mein highest priority hai.

2
00:00:02,902 --> 00:00:06,320
Har raat 2 baje automatic backup hota hai — cloud pe.

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:12,059
Owner Console mein Backups section mein aap dekh sakte hain last 30 days ke backups list.

4
00:00:12,059 --> 00:00:15,284
Har backup ka size, timestamp, aur restore button.

5
00:00:15,284 --> 00:00:19,411
Kabhi galti se koi wrong change hua ya data corrupt lag raha hai

6
00:00:19,411 --> 00:00:23,216
bas ek click mein pichhle backup se restore kar sakte hain.

7
00:00:23,216 --> 00:00:28,311
Ek zaroori baat — restore karne se pehle current state ka backup lena chaahiye.

8
00:00:28,311 --> 00:00:32,890
Manual Backup button hai — dabaayein, current snapshot save ho jaayega.

9
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,631
Fir safe se restore kariye.
